OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening 
OL,6,Fwill be dry with clear spells. Then    
OL,7,Fthe rest of the night will be dry with 
OL,8,Fclear periods, some cloud around at    
OL,9,Ftimes. Patchy frost and freshening     
OL,10,Fsoutheasterly wind adding to the cold  
OL,11,Ffeel.                                  
OL,13,CSunday:FDry with variable amounts of   
OL,14,Fcloud and some sunny intervals. Fresh  
OL,15,Fto strong east or southeasterly winds  
OL,16,Falong west coast.                      
OL,18,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry   
OL,19,Fand bright on Monday. Chance of rain   
OL,20,Fat times on Tuesday and Wednesday.     
OL,21,FFresh southeasterly wind.              
